{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"尼古拉·特斯拉·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"nikola-tesla","categoryLabel":"尼古拉·特斯拉","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":2.5,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/03_nikola-tesla/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"尼古拉-特斯拉-影响与遗产\">尼古拉·特斯拉·影响与遗产</h1><p>1943 年 1 月，特斯拉在纽约人旅馆（Hotel New Yorker）3327 号房间孤独离世时，几乎已被主流社会遗忘。他晚年负债、独居、与鸽子为伴，报纸上只剩下&quot;古怪发明家&quot;的标签。然而八十多年后的今天，他的名字出现在每一份物理课本、每一座变电站、每一辆电动汽车的标牌上——这种从默默无闻到全球符号的逆转，本身就是科技史上最耐人寻味的&quot;身后剧本&quot;之一。</p>\n<p>本卷不再复述特斯拉做了什么，而是追问：他留下了什么，以及世界如何记住他。这是两件不完全重合的事。一方面，多相交流系统、感应电动机、谐振耦合等真实的技术遗产，至今仍在为现代电网与无线充电供电，其底层原理一个世纪未被推翻；另一方面，围绕&quot;自由能源&quot;&quot;死光&quot;&quot;被压制的天才&quot;等传说，又生长出一个与历史事实时有出入的&quot;特斯拉神话&quot;。</p>\n<p>我们把这份遗产拆成三条线索。第一条是科学与技术遗产：从国际单位制中以他命名的磁通密度单位&quot;特斯拉&quot;，到交流电网与无线输电技术在 21 世纪的复兴。第二条是文化形象与大众复兴：从冷战后期的边缘人物，到互联网漫画、影视、以及马斯克的电动车公司共同重塑的流行偶像；以及全球范围内的纪念馆、雕像与博物馆。第三条是声誉变迁与史学评价：神话与史料之间的张力，以及卡尔森（W. Bernard Carlson）等学者如何在&quot;孤独天才&quot;叙事之外，还原一个更可信、也更复杂的特斯拉。</p>\n<p>理解特斯拉的遗产，需要同时握住两端：既不把他贬为被高估的怪人，也不把他抬成无所不能的先知。真正的难点在于，他的真实成就已经足够伟大，以至于不需要神话来加持；而神话之所以顽固，恰恰因为它回应了大众对&quot;被埋没的纯粹理想主义者&quot;的情感需求。</p>\n<p>本卷下设三章共八篇文档。建议先读&quot;科学与技术遗产&quot;建立事实地基，再进入&quot;文化形象&quot;与&quot;史学评价&quot;，体会同一个人如何在工程、文化与历史三重坐标系中被反复书写。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-and-technical-legacy","title":"科学与技术遗产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ac-grid-and-modern-power","title":"交流电网与现代电力系统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/ac-grid-and-modern-power"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tesla-unit-and-honors","title":"特斯拉单位与命名荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/tesla-unit-and-honors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wireless-and-future-tech-revival","title":"无线输电与未来技术的复兴","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/scientific-and-technical-legacy/wireless-and-future-tech-revival"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-image-and-popular-revival","title":"文化形象与大众复兴","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/cultural-image-and-popular-revival","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-obscurity-to-cult-figure","title":"从默默无闻到大众偶像","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/cultural-image-and-popular-revival/from-obscurity-to-cult-figure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-and-tesla-namesake","title":"影视形象与\"特斯拉\"品牌","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/cultural-image-and-popular-revival/media-and-tesla-namesake"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memorials-and-museums","title":"纪念馆、博物馆与众筹奇迹","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/cultural-image-and-popular-revival/memorials-and-museums"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"reputation-and-historiography","title":"声誉变迁与史学评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/reputation-and-historiography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"myth-versus-historical-record","title":"神话与史料：逐项核对","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/reputation-and-historiography/myth-versus-historical-record"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scholarly-reassessment","title":"史学反思：在神话之外重估特斯拉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/influence-and-legacy/reputation-and-historiography/scholarly-reassessment"}]}]}